cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Polyglot Checkout Bench"
message: "If you use this dataset or harness, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Oludele
    given-names: Halleluyah
    email: halleluyaholudele@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/hallelx2/polyglot-bench"
abstract: >-
  Ten implementations of one database-bound business transaction — order pricing
  and checkout — across TypeScript, Go and Rust, proved byte-for-byte identical
  before measurement, then benchmarked over 450 runs with Friedman/Nemenyi
  analysis and pre-specified contrasts. Includes the raw per-run result files.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - performance
  - postgresql
  - typescript
  - go
  - rust
  - reproducible-research
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-22"
